OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas markets 2026: Where to
OL,4,Ago in the South West and Channel
OL,5,AIslands
OL,6,
OL,7,FChristmas markets are returning to town
OL,8,Fcentres, cathedral grounds and high
OL,9,Fstreets across the south-west of
OL,10,FEngland and the Channel Islands.
OL,12,FSuch events can attract scores of
OL,13,Fpeople as part of the festive season
OL,14,Fcelebrations. Most are free to get
OL,15,Finto, although a few require tickets.
OL,17,FStreet entertainment and Santa's
OL,18,Fgrottos will be featured at many, with
OL,19,Fa best-dressed Christmas dog
OL,20,Fcompetition, festive tractor parade and
OL,21,Fboat trips also on offer.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
